        "notes": "## **First round, easy build**\n\nPick **RENAISSANCE** because you sure want to escape after reviving a teammate. This will help you with a lil valk for about 4 seconds, so you can fly away faster and sometimes without needing someone nearby.\n\nPut **Compensator** to have a bit of weapon power and **Weapon Grease** to speed up heals.\n\nThen, go to *Survival* and take **First Aid Kit** so you will regenerate your own life faster.\n\nAnd that's all for first round, cya later!",
