        "notes": "## **Second round, things are getting interesting**\n\n**I usually sell everything and then buy again what I need more, because I want to see how much cash I own before buying.**\n\nImmediatly go to *Survival* and take **the one and only** ***AERODYNAMICS FEATHERS***. You might ask: \"Why should I take it?\" Because **you want to fly FAST**. Imagine Soldier-76, ok? He's aimbotted, he has aimbot even when he poops to center the toilet because he can't live without aimbotting everything, ok? With this and a bit of *ability power* you will fly everywhere and the enemy won't notice it. Need a bit of practice because in the first two rounds you need to play the passive Mercy, but no worries: things will change later.\n\nSo, go to *Ability*, put **Power Playbook**.\n\nAfter that, go to *Weapon* and put **Talon Modification Module** to have more weapon power for your heals and mantain **Weapon Grease** for the speed.\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTE**\nIf you don't have enough cash to buy these items, I've put as optional the **Icy Coolant** item which gives you weapon power and *cooldown reduction*, or you can take again the classic **Compensator** which costs only 1k.\n\nBe ready for 3rd round! \ud83d\ude0e",
