        "notes": "## **LET'S GET THIS PARTY STARTED**\n\nNow the funny part starts: **TIME TO DPS**! ULT and go to the enemy, be fast and shoot them all \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\n\n**POWER**: immediatly take **Crepuscular Circle** to have automated Valk, heal+boost are given to allies, you don't need to keep focus on them (just stay in range, don't fly too far).\n\n**Sell every item you bought before EXCEPT for Aerodynamic Feathers**\n\nBuy these in *Weapon*:\n**Talon Modification Module** for weapon power and **Aftermarket Firing Pin** for attack speed and a bit of move speed. Take also **Mid-Air Mobilizer** to be a flying k1ller \ud83d\ude0e\n\nIn *Ability*:\n**Wrist Wraps** for a bit of AP because of the flying mode.\n\n**INFORMATIONS**:\nDepending on the match, and depending of how much cash you have, you might not have enough to buy all the things I've listed. If you have more, you might choose in ***Weapon*** something else instead of **Compensator** or **Mid-Air Mobilizer**. It's up on you, but let the base being that one I gave you.",
