        "notes": "## **IT'S GETTING EVEN BETTER**!\n\n**Sell every item you bought before EXCEPT for Aerodynamic Feathers**\n\nIn *Ability* the first thing to buy is: **Resurrection Rangefinder** which gives cooldown reduction but the best thing is that you can resurrect far from the fallen body, it works also mid-air and most of the time enemies don't understand it, so with the power of the **Aerodynamic Feathers** you can be very quick to fly there, revive and fly away with the mini-Valk!\n\nOther things to re-buy: **Talon Modification Module**, **Aftermarket Firing Pin** and **Compensator** in *Weapon*, **Wrist Wraps** in *Ability*.\n\n**INFORMATIONS**: Again, depending on the match and on how much cash you have, you may want to sell the *Aerodynamic Wings* to complete this part of build, you can take it again in the next round.\nGave you two optional things to swap the *Compensator*.",
